    "title": "Educator of the Year Mannington Middle's Yoho showcases nearly 2 decades of teaching excellence | Fairmont News | wvnews.com",
    "text": "FAIRMONT, W.Va. — The Marion County Chamber of Commerce’s Educator of the Year is Mannington Middle School math teacher Heather Yoho, who officials say has been a leader, mentor and role model for her students for nearly 20 years.\nYoho first worked for Marion County Schools as a substitute teacher and critical skills tutor before finding her home in the classroom in 2008 as a math teacher at Mannington Middle School. She has also served as coordinator for the county’s Math Field Day since 2018.",
